==Greatest maximum depth by continent==
* '''[[Africa]]''' &mdash; 1: [[Lake Tanganyika|Tanganyika]], 2: [[Lake Malawi|Malawi]], 3: [[Lake Kivu|Kivu]]
* '''[[Antarctica]]''' &mdash; 1: [[Radok Lake|Radok]] (surface lake). &mdash; 1: [[Lake Vostok|Vostok]] (subglacial lake),<ref name=Vostok/> 2: [[Concordia Subglacial Lake|Concordia]] (subglacial lake), 3: [[Lake Ellsworth (Antarctica)|Ellsworth]] (subglacial lake).
* '''[[Asia]]''' &mdash; 1: [[Lake Baikal|Baikal]], 2: [[Issyk Kul]], 3: [[Lake Matano|Matano]]
* '''[[Eurasia]]''' &mdash; 1: [[Lake Baikal|Baikal]], 2: [[Caspian Sea]], 3: [[Issyk Kul]]
* '''[[Europe]]''' &mdash; 1: [[Hornindalsvatnet]], 2: [[Salvatnet]], 3: [[Lake Tinn]] 
* '''[[North America]]''' &mdash; 1: [[Great Slave Lake|Great Slave]], 2: [[Crater Lake|Crater]], 3: [[Quesnel Lake|Quesnel]]
** '''[[Central America]]''' &mdash; 1: [[Lago de Atitlán|Atitlán]], 2: [[Laguna Chicabal|Chicabal]], 3: [[Lake Ilopango|Ilopango]]
* '''[[Oceania]]''' &mdash; 1: [[Lake Hauroko|Hauroko]], 2: [[Lake Manapouri|Manapouri]], 3: [[Lake Te Anau|Te Anau]] 
** '''[[Australia]]''' &mdash; 1: [[Lake St Clair (Tasmania)|St Clair]]
* '''[[South America]]''' &mdash; 1: [[Lake Viedma|Viedma]], 2: [[O'Higgins/San Martín Lake|O'Higgins/San Martín]], 3: [[Lake Argentino|Argentino]]

